


 Minutes of FIGGY BAR RT Conference.

 FIGGY BAR of 25 April 1991. Notice on the door reads: Welcome to another open
 FIGGY BAR. Are you ready for dpANS Forth ? Would you like Wil Baden to restart
 the 'puzzels' topic ? If none of these appeal to you, start your own  ax 
 grinding (Forth related). Your FIG-tender is Gary. We didn't discuss the
 puzzels. We did discuss dpANS and give quick personnel sketches.

Date: 04/25/91   Time: 22:26EDT
Attendees:
[GARY-S]
[[Dennis] D.RUFFER]
[[Len] NMORGENSTERN]
[[doug] D.GARRETT]

Minutes:
<D.RUFFER> is here.
